@api = http://localhost:18080

### Create an order in the Docker environment.
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalId":"DOCKER-001","customerName":"Cliente demonstração","totalValue":125.50}

### Process pending orders (scheduler may have processed them already).
POST {{api}}/orders/process

### List orders.
GET {{api}}/orders

### ERP health.
GET http://localhost:18081/health
